Package: DataComR
Title: Compare Datasets the Way SAS PROC COMPARE Does
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Ganhua", "Lu", , "ganhualu@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Compares a base dataset with a compare dataset following the
    semantics of SAS PROC COMPARE: ID variables, numeric comparison methods,
    a PROC COMPARE-style listing and a SYSINFO-style return code. Aimed at
    clinical and pharmaceutical validation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 8.0.0
Imports:
    cli,
    dplyr,
    rlang,
    tibble,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/ganhualu/DataComR
